FSDD TARGET CHECK -- no search. digits 0 vs 1, N=64, 600 clips (300/300), 20 seeds,
per-seed 400/100/100 split, 50 train epochs. objective = acc - 1.00*energy.

  support                taps   contig   val acc  test acc   objective
